Efu_Text_Wake = Cold concrete.\nThe smell of smoke and rust.{be01}\nSomething stirs in the dark.{be01}
Efu_Text_WhichType = Which Pokémon stayed with you?
Efu_Text_WhichOne = Which one?
Efu_Text_ThisOne = {0101:1}...\nIs that the one?
Efu_Text_StayedWithYou = {0101:1} stayed with you.
Efu_Text_Back = Back
Efu_Text_BoardedDoor = The door is locked tight.
Efu_Text_BedRest = A thin mattress on the concrete.\nRest for a while?
Efu_Text_BedRested = You slept badly.{be01}\nYour Pokémon recovered a little.
Efu_Text_RaidDepart = Past this gate, nothing is safe.{be01}\nAnything you carry out there\ncan be lost.{be01}\nHead out to explore?
Efu_Text_RaidNoTeam = You won't last a minute out there\nwithout a Pokémon that can fight.{be01}
Efu_Text_Saving = Saving...\nDon't turn off the power.
Efu_Text_RaidReturn = You made it back.{be01}
Efu_Text_RaidLost = You never made it back.{be01}\nEvery Pokémon you took\nout there is gone.{be01}
Efu_Text_LostSoul = A {0101:1} crept out of the dark,\nas lost as you are.{be01}\nIt stays close to you.{be01}
Efu_Text_Blackout = Everything went black.{be01}\nYou woke up at home, alone.\nYour Pokémon are gone.{be01}
Efu_Text_ScavDrop = The scav dropped {ff00:2}{0109:0}{ff00:0}.\nYou picked it up.
Efu_Text_ScavDropFull = The scav dropped {ff00:2}{0109:0}{ff00:0}.\nIt's on the ground beside you.
Efu_Text_ScavDropLost = The scav dropped {ff00:2}{0109:0}{ff00:0},\nbut it rolled away out of reach.
Efu_Text_GroundTake = You picked up {ff00:2}{0109:0}{ff00:0}.
Efu_Text_GroundSwapped = You left the {0109:1}\nand picked up {ff00:2}{0109:0}{ff00:0}.
Efu_Text_TossLost = There was nowhere to put\n{ff00:2}{0109:0}{ff00:0} down. It's gone.
Efu_Text_NurseOffer = Welcome back.{be01}\nA full heal costs a dollar a level.\nFor your team, that's ${0204:0}. Shall I?
Efu_Text_NurseDone = There! All patched up.\nTake care out there.
Efu_Text_NurseBye = All right. Come back if you need me.
Efu_Text_NotEnoughMoney = Oh... You don't have enough money.
Efu_Text_JoyOffer = Oh! You're not a scav, are you?{be01}\nI'm a nurse. I treat whoever makes it\nthrough these woods.{be01}\nI can heal your team for ${0204:0},\na dollar a level. Shall I?
Efu_Text_JoyJoin = You have a base by the sea?{be01}\nIt has a Pokémon Center? Then for ${0204:0},\nI'll set up there. Deal?
Efu_Text_JoyJoined = It'll be good to have a roof again.\nI'll see you at the counter!
Efu_Text_JoyStay = Then I'll stay out here a while longer.\nBe careful.
Efu_Text_ClerkIntro = Oh! Someone's still here?{be01}\nWhen the evacuation came, the ships\nleft without most of us.{be01}\nThe staff here went with them.\nI stayed. Where would I go?{be01}\nI can still source supplies, but\nnothing's cheap anymore.{be01}\nAnd I'll buy whatever you drag back\nfrom out there. I'll be at the counter.
Efu_Text_DayCareOffer = I'm the Day-Care Lady. Or I was.{be01}\nWith scavs about, nobody leaves their\nPokémon with me anymore.{be01}\nYou have somewhere safe? For ${0204:0},\nI'll move in and raise your Pokémon.
Efu_Text_DayCareJoined = I'll set up there, and still come out\nhere to take in Pokémon.{be01}\nYou collect them at the base. Each time\nyou come back, they'll be a bit stronger.
Efu_Text_GateGuide = Route 3 is as far as anyone dares\nto go now.{be01}\nWhen the roads farther out are safe,\nI'll take you there.
Efu_Text_GuideMeet = Another survivor? You came out of\nthe old warehouses, right?{be01}\nI used to guide travelers from the\ngate there. I know every road.{be01}\nI'll set up at the gate again.\nFind me there to go farther out.
Efu_Text_BlockedDoor = A boulder blocks the way in.
Efu_Text_LockerHolds = Your locker. {0201:0} of 20 slots are in use.
Efu_Text_LockerSlot = {0109:0} x{0201:1}
Efu_Text_LockerStore = Store everything
Efu_Text_LockerClose = Close
Efu_Text_LockerWhat = {ff00:2}{0109:0}{ff00:0}: take one,\nor sell one for ${0201:1}?
Efu_Text_LockerTake = Take
Efu_Text_LockerSell = Sell
Efu_Text_LockerCancel = Cancel
Efu_Text_LockerBagFull = Your Bag only carries one item.\nGive it to a Pokémon or store it first.
Efu_Text_LockerNoSale = Nobody would pay for that.
Efu_Text_LockerStoredFull = Stored {0201:0}. The locker is full,\nso {0201:1} didn't fit.
Efu_Text_LockerNothing = There's nothing to store.
